## Endpoints

### Auth Flow (6)
- `GET /{token}` — Authenticate user with a token.
- `GET /api/auth/session` — Check the current authentication session.
- `GET /api/auth/session/` — Check the current authentication session (alternative).
- `GET /Assets/Lfwd/Images/{ImageToken}` — Retrieve an image using a token.
- `GET /libs/granite/csrf/token.json` — Obtain a CSRF token for secure requests.
- `GET /sso/authorize` — Authorize user via Single Sign-On.

### Data Read (4)
- `GET /channels/api/v2/client/{clientId}/translations/4/nl-informal.json` — Get client translations in Dutch.
- `GET /dxpweb/public/nl/eneco/averagereviewscore` — Get average review score.
- `GET /ip2isp/v1/convert` — Convert IP address to ISP information.
- `GET /services/promotions/consumer` — Retrieve consumer promotion details.

### Data Write (1)
- `POST /services/hawaii-catalog/enrichment/consumer` — Enrich consumer catalog data.

### Search (1)
- `POST /_api/shop-product-discovery/v1/graphql` — Search for products using GraphQL.

### Media (2)
- `GET /Assets/Lfwd/JavaScripts/Static` — Retrieve static JavaScript assets.
- `GET /Assets/StyleSheets/Static/DesignSystem/Lfwd` — Retrieve static stylesheet assets.

### Config (2)
- `GET /scripts/b/ai.config.1.cfg.json` — Get AI configuration settings.
- `POST /channels/api/v2/client/{clientId}/configs` — Update client configurations.

